* [Stacks Project, Tag 0BYU](https://stacks.math.columbia.edu/tag/0BYU)
* [Stacks Project, Tag 08JJ](https://stacks.math.columbia.edu/tag/08JJ)
-/

@[expose] public noncomputable section

